  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">• About Our Brand and Products:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Melanin•Me is a culture-first skincare brand created specifically for melanin-rich skin. Rooted in tradition and inspired by the power of turmeric root, our products are designed to simplify skincare while helping customers achieve healthy-looking, radiant skin.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Our debut collection, </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">The Melanin Method™</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">, includes:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">🤎 </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Clean Slate™</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"> – Turmeric Gel Cleanser</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">🌱 </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Root Water™</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"> – Turmeric Root Mist</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✨ </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Culture Balm™</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"> – Turmeric Root Cream</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Together, these three products create a simple daily ritual to cleanse, hydrate, and moisturize.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';color:#808080;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">• What Makes Us Different:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Created with melanin-rich skin in mind</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Culture-first brand built around community</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Turmeric-root-focused formulas</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Inclusive representation and storytelling</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Simple, beginner-friendly skincare routines</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Exclusive creator community known as the </span><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Melanin Mob</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">✔ Founding Creators have the opportunity to grow alongside the brand from the very beginning</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We’re not just building a skincare brand—we’re building a movement rooted in culture and made for melanin.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';color:#808080;min-height:13.8px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 14px 0px;font:14px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:14px;\">• How Affiliates Can Earn:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn commission on every qualified sale generated through their unique affiliate link or discount code.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Current Founding Creator Benefits:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">🤎 15% Commission 